# Frontend Standards — Financieramente App

## Overview

This document is the canonical reference for all frontend development in the Financieramente codebase.

Stack: Next.js 15 App Router, React 19, TypeScript 5, Tailwind CSS v4, Shadcn/UI + Radix UI, Zod, React Hook Form.

